  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>轉生就是蜘蛛：額外模組 | 開發中</strong></h1>\n<h2><strong>種族：</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>（魔人）蜘蛛族：</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">蜘蛛族</span> &gt; <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">織絲者</span> &gt; <span style=\"color:#169179\">影織者</span> &gt; <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">蛛后君主</span> &gt;<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> <strong>原初蛛后</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>（魔人）龜族：</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">龜族</span>&nbsp;&gt; <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">大地守護者</span> &gt; <span style=\"color:#169179\">泰坦巨龜</span> &gt; <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">利維坦陸龜</span> &gt;<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> <strong>世界之殼<br><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>（魔人）影行者：</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">影行者</span> &gt; <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">星際行者</span> &gt; <span style=\"color:#169179\">星雲石族</span> &gt; <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">宇宙吞噬者</span> &gt;<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> <strong>蝕日者</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<h2><strong>種族技能：</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>蜘蛛族：</strong><span style=\"color:#86f1fc\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">黏著鋼絲</span><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">，</span> </span>蜘蛛感知</span></p>\n<p><strong>織絲者：</strong><span style=\"color:#34495e\">魔法抗性</span></p>\n<p><strong>影織者：</strong><span style=\"color:#86f1fc\">暗影融合</span></p>\n<p><strong>原初蛛后：</strong><span style=\"color:#86f1fc\">神聖氣</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>龜族：</strong><span style=\"color:#34495e\">魔法抗性</span><strong>，</strong><span style=\"color:#34495e\">物理攻擊抗性</span></p>\n<p><strong>大地守護者：</strong><span style=\"color:#86f1fc\">偏轉外殼</span></p>\n<p><strong>泰坦巨龜：</strong><span style=\"color:#86f1fc\">地震</span></p>\n<p><strong>世界之殼：</strong><span style=\"color:#86f1fc\">神聖氣<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">，</span></span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">超高速再生</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>影行者：</strong><span style=\"color:#34495e\">空間攻擊抗性</span><strong>，</strong><span style=\"color:#86f1fc\">向量切換</span></p>\n<p><strong>星際行者：</strong><span style=\"color:#86f1fc\">空間干擾</span></p>\n<p><strong>星雲石族：</strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">重力操縱，空間操縱</span></p>\n<p><strong>蝕日者 ：&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color:#86f1fc\">神聖氣<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">，</span></span> 奇點引力（將於 1.0.5 版本實裝）</span></p>\n<p><strong>必須將種族填入 'tensura-reincarnated' 配置檔案中</strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>tensuraextras:arachnid | tensuraextras:turtlet | tensuraextras:umbrakin</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>製作人員：AniBlake</div>\n</div>",
